{"3743690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fatal Gaming", "steam_appid": 3743690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fatal Gaming:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatal Gaming is atmospheric horror in cyberpunk world, where the only way to earn money is to take part in deadly online show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show needs to entertain the audience, and how can one entertain anyone without risking their life? That's right - no way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.poster.avif?t=1763809756\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.webm?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.mp4?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror elements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk setting</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/a20b88c201646a79c62402e173fef8db.poster.avif?t=1763809756\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/a20b88c201646a79c62402e173fef8db.webm?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/a20b88c201646a79c62402e173fef8db.mp4?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is new game with variable mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.poster.avif?t=1763809756\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.webm?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/557cd91ee66e6ee79d0d6cc40d9620a5.mp4?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fatal Gaming:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatal Gaming is atmospheric horror in cyberpunk world, where the only way to earn money is to take part in deadly online show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show needs to entertain the audience, and how can one entertain anyone without risking their life? That's right - no way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.poster.avif?t=1763809756\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743690/extras/140f17701a998b02928cce0aa2a3db46.webm?t=1763809756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor